3363
02:06:36.010 --> 02:06:39.600
that getting sober

3364
02:06:39.600 --> 02:06:43.820
led to performing more esteemable acts

3365
02:06:43.820 --> 02:06:45.807
on behalf of myself and behalf of other people.

3366
02:06:45.807 --> 02:06:47.950
And esteemable acts, in turn,

3367
02:06:47.950 --> 02:06:51.290
lead to elevated self-esteem, which in turn,

3368
02:06:51.290 --> 02:06:54.620
expands your horizon of what's possible for yourself.

3369
02:06:54.620 --> 02:06:58.140
In other words, you begin to believe in yourself.

3370
02:06:58.140 --> 02:06:59.920
You begin to believe that you can do more

3371
02:06:59.920 --> 02:07:00.970
and you can be more.

3372
02:07:00.970 --> 02:07:04.690
And that means that you end up taking on things

3373
02:07:04.690 --> 02:07:06.850
that you never would have previously.

3374
02:07:06.850 --> 02:07:09.240
You get more interested in bettering yourself

3375
02:07:09.240 --> 02:07:13.260
and in improving the quality of life of those around you

3376
02:07:13.260 --> 02:07:17.440
and challenges that once might've seemed impossible,

3377
02:07:17.440 --> 02:07:19.240
you end up welcoming.

3378
02:07:19.240 --> 02:07:20.650
And in my case, that took the form

3379
02:07:20.650 --> 02:07:22.140
of these endurance challenges,

3380
